<title>USA: Santa Barbara Bancorp buys leasing assets.</title>
<headline>Santa Barbara Bancorp buys leasing assets.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santa Barbara Bank &amp; Trust, a wholly owned subsidiary of Santa Barbara Bancorp, on Tuesday reached a definitive agreement to purchase the commercial leasing assets of California Thrift &amp; Loan.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the agreement provides for Santa Barbara Bank &amp; Trust to pay cash for the leases. The transaction is valued at approximately $61.5 million and is expected to close early in December 1996.</p>
</text>
